  "title": "Oil Rich Italian Eggplant Pasta",
  "description": "A sour and chewy Italian dish featuring eggplant, seeds, and a tadka, perfect for a lazy Sunday, with ayurvedic tamasic friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "diet": [
